      <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationComponent" name="View subsystem" id="id-e066e76140ff500fbbf7a678869c86ba">
        <documentation>View generation and layout for Archi (Scripts/View): selection → object set → layout graph → engine (ELK, Dagre, Graphviz, Tiles) → write plan → view. Three layers, each talks only to the one below (ARCHITECTURE § Structure).</documentation>
