      <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationComponent" name="Entry scripts" id="id-f5a4dd0d15bc59c2be7b3bbb66865ffe">
        <documentation>Layer 1, headless: the .ajs files in Scripts/View that the architect runs on a selection without the dialog. Each is a few lines that call run_preset.js with a fixed action and overrides, or with the session. For example: _generate.ajs (New view with the base preset), _expand.ajs (Expand view), _layout_only.ajs (Layout only), _layout_LR.ajs (Layout only, Left → Right, no nesting) and _layout_session_cycle.ajs (the session, the next algorithm start each run). _gui.ajs is not one of them: it opens the dialog.</documentation>
        <property key="path" value="Scripts/View/_*.ajs"/>
        <property key="runtime" value="Archi"/>
        <property key="typechecked" value="no"/>
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      </element>
