        <documentation>Outside the View subsystem: the scripts in Scripts/GEMMA/GGM that generate or lay out views with View, through its public API (ARCHITECTURE § Public API). 4_ggm_gemma_views.ajs generates the views of the GGM data objects and GEMMA business objects per policy domain with generate_view, with presets in presets/GEMMA/GGM; ggmBO_Generate_LR.ajs, ggmDO_Layout_TB.ajs and four more run the preset their file name names through run_preset.js; include_ggm_gemma.js holds their GGM/GEMMA helpers. shortcuts/GEMMA/ is git-ignored and may hold more callers.</documentation>
        <property key="path" value="Scripts/GEMMA/GGM/"/>
        <property key="runtime" value="Archi"/>
        <property key="typechecked" value="no"/>
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      </element>
    </folder>
    <folder name="CI" id="id-a8a2efa9eb115909b43322640a68a954">
      <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationComponent" name="check.yml (CI workflow)" id="id-72c7ed83f7b65cddb6e5e4bf1c7262c6">
        <documentation>GitHub Actions workflow on every push and pull request, from a clean clone: Graphviz 14.1.4 and the Times font as locally, then typecheck, unit, consistency, fingerprints without Graphviz, rule checks. Archi does not run there.</documentation>
        <property key="path" value=".github/workflows/check.yml"/>
        <property key="runtime" value="GitHub Actions"/>
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      </element>
    </folder>
    <folder name="Services" id="id-e60445ff6e9757b4a39a6f186a3f559c">
      <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="Generate a view" id="id-bdfafda081e4563d9cd5f313a33758e3">
        <documentation>Through the Public API: validate the preset, run the action (New view, One view each, Expand view, Layout only; default New view) on the selection, return the written views.</documentation>
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      </element>
      <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="Run a process" id="id-13f004c11e995c0b84e12e4e825db787">
        <documentation>The ProcessRunner contract (types/layout.d.ts): runProcess(command, args, input, timeoutSeconds) → { state: finished | timeout | not-found, exitCode, stdout, stderr }; input and output through temp files, deleted again; never throws for the three states. Java ProcessBuilder in Archi, child_process in Node; the caller gets the runner passed in.</documentation>
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      </element>
      <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="Lay out a graph" id="id-4894d8fe13f25fb5966d619b5bd2e085">
        <documentation>The LayoutAdapter contract (types/layout.d.ts): layout(graph, runProcess) → layout result, and checkEngineParams(preset). One adapter per engine, found through the registry; the same adapter runs in Archi and in Node.</documentation>
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      </element>
      <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="Measure text" id="id-9a64ae42fd1b5290afafa5b47da87d0f">
        <documentation>The TextMeasure contract (types/layout.d.ts): the width of a line of text in a font, and where it may break. SWT and Archi's own classes in Archi; an estimate set to what Archi measures in Node. Passed in to the label sizing.</documentation>
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      </element>
    </folder>
    <folder name="Processes" id="id-6780d4794ec8523fb286a75c0ec04c80">
      <folder name="Run View" id="id-4ed06dae54c455edb915a1d6b6f786b1">
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Run the dialog" id="id-9fd5facada9a5a83bca8f0ec676914a2">
          <documentation>Capture the selection, read the session, read a selected view once, build the tabs, recount on every committed change; an action closes the dialog, saves the session and calls the API (ARCHITECTURE § Run flow).</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Recount the dialog" id="id-5a15831ef1ba5ac0a1f16923b24a04a6">
          <documentation>On every committed change: dialogCounts calls the same pipeline helpers as a run (steps, nesting, totals, style check).</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Save, rename or delete a preset" id="id-d7f8896571be56ce8001fa10831877cc">
          <documentation>The preset row writes or moves the preset file; Default stays read-only.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Run headless" id="id-559e224e724453f08fc799252d1b3d89">
          <documentation>File name → preset, action and direction; or the base preset; or the session (next algorithm start saved). Read the preset, apply the overrides, ask before many views, call the API.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Generate a view" id="id-249cbb39d7e553c38af291f1a11d0932">
          <documentation>The API run (generate_view): validate → read → plan → create or empty the view → apply → style → view properties.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Validate the preset" id="id-6dfd6483b0865591801d72929d072586">
          <documentation>validatePreset fills defaults and strips unknown keys; effectiveParams masks params the algorithm does not use.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Read the selection" id="id-84469fa7091b56a4b62a5974cffde442">
          <documentation>readSelection reads the selection, the relations and, on a Modify action, the target view once into a Snapshot.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Plan the view" id="id-1fdfabd9d5aa5c3bab922e909fe9f85c">
          <documentation>plan(), pure: object set → relation roles → layout graph → engine (until the container labels fit) → write plan.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Compose the object set" id="id-6dd6cee7315d59278ec67c6e99692523">
          <documentation>Filter, related-elements steps, relation collection, predicted counts.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Build the layout graph" id="id-b81005821f595ddc981ca5d8a92b13c2">
          <documentation>Split nesting relations, resolve nesting, pair occurrences with visuals; nodes = occurrences, edges = routed relations; label room.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Lay out" id="id-0e548b9633825644a66278c30d843dfa">
          <documentation>The engine adapter turns the layout graph into a layout result, in a Node process or in the script.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Plan the write" id="id-e3a3e1d590905e4ba45f0b626438a692">
          <documentation>Nodes parents first (keep, move, create), removals, connections with bendpoints, nestings, managed-occurrence records.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Apply the write plan" id="id-08d0dcd00dc55207a235ec592c7555fa">
          <documentation>The writer follows the write plan on the target view; the only step that changes a view.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Style the view" id="id-09c99b488ac95b06800444c0f606bb39">
          <documentation>The appearance pass on the written view: colours, fonts, line widths.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
      </folder>
      <folder name="Run the tests" id="id-0742299f0f3350b88353c77a6a84444a">
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Typecheck" id="id-20e1a93494a65460aa670185e0609a4e">
          <documentation>npm run typecheck: tsc on the JSDoc of lib/** and three _lib modules against the typed contracts (types/*.d.ts, jarchi.d.ts).</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Unit tests" id="id-5e4ff86388ed5a94beddfba2a396719d">
          <documentation>rel_filter_test, nesting_test, tiles_test, compose_test, counts_test.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Consistency checks" id="id-727513b52f1d5205a487632c15780e1b">
          <documentation>check_registry.js and gen_docs_tables.js (check mode).</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Plan a real view" id="id-bbf1f471dcef5e65a81946ce86426f76">
          <documentation>view_harness.js on a view of a model file: object set → nesting → layout graph → engine → write plan.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Compare write-plan fingerprints" id="id-f9c9518620b5595b8e8032af5a26af75">
          <documentation>write_plans.js --check (and --variants) against the expected files.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Compare layout fingerprints" id="id-06098bdf06e95d38858868cbbbd8ec85">
          <documentation>tools/compare-layouts.js --check (repo root): the layouts of test views 1–4 per preset × algorithm against layouts.txt. The tool itself is not in this model.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Check the layout rules" id="id-aa13572d881d5063b4b2487f0688fd50">
          <documentation>layout_checks.js --check (and --variants, --large) against the known violations.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Check the written views" id="id-1f00bf7e7a705341adcbd5e40a100de1">
          <documentation>archi_cli.sh run_baseline.ajs on a copy, then compare-views.js against the committed baseline and console_checks.js on the console.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Check the rendering" id="id-4072ef8ad16050d09963ab954f9bf204">
          <documentation>archi_cli.sh render_views.ajs, then svg_checks.js; svg_checks_probe.ajs checks the checks.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Time the run in Archi" id="id-b2411843078b5f11b304d88ae9dbefe3">
          <documentation>archi_cli.sh run_large.ajs, then console_checks.js: how long Archi is busy on view 5.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
      </folder>
      <folder name="Maintain test data and settings" id="id-bd74abb0ae1955b1bd583cb013213624">
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Build the test model" id="id-e3f3a8d35ce952cbb0bdeb39efe74194">
          <documentation>build_test_model.ajs with test_model_views.js.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Generate the doc tables" id="id-16361521a39e5010ac8aec5ebb834e1e">
          <documentation>gen_docs_tables.js --write rewrites the tables that mirror defs.js.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Rewrite expected files" id="id-ff605fbbe4e955f995fbbaa730b6af9e">
          <documentation>A tool's --write rewrites its expected file for a meant change.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Compare preset and session" id="id-627d3bfca3df5714b9eac984f7982166">
          <documentation>preset_diff.js: what actually ran against the preset, after defaults.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Migrate presets" id="id-def65a206fee5fab8899488bf0fe1a5e">
          <documentation>A one-shot migration rewrites every preset and the session to the new schema version.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
      </folder>
      <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Run View" id="id-524c6099c9ca5da8beb17f1280b7a907">
        <documentation>A run of the View scripts: the dialog or a headless entry script, then the API generates the view.</documentation>
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      </element>
      <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Run the tests" id="id-f3c3a365b48051cd833fae8f2fd51d9b">
        <documentation>The test levels from cheap to Archi (ARCHITECTURE § Development and testing): typecheck, unit, consistency, harness, fingerprints, rule checks in Node; written views, rendering and time through Archi's command line.</documentation>
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      </element>
      <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="Maintain test data and settings" id="id-559761767e5752e78b2308cca17d2e56">
        <documentation>Rebuild the test model, regenerate the doc tables, rewrite expected files, compare a preset with the session, migrate presets to a new schema.</documentation>
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      </element>
      <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationProcess" name="CI check" id="id-22884f86d8035eb2ad20d710b85ea892">
        <documentation>check.yml on every push and pull request: typecheck, unit, consistency, fingerprints (without the Graphviz algorithms), rule checks. Fails the push on any difference.</documentation>
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
      </element>
    </folder>
    <folder name="Data" id="id-8cb9c331967d54ac8a320cffad279e30">
      <folder name="Runtime contracts" id="id-c2456dcdf19458f28c0d02a269e09852">
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Snapshot" id="id-1c2cc5ff6342556db8e8cbc35e4af94d">
          <documentation>What a run works on, read once from Archi: selection, relation index, the target view's visuals (types/view.d.ts). The harness's readSnapshot produces the same shape from a model file.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Object set" id="id-ec8373c581dd53a3b5919cd4e7fad7ca">
          <documentation>The elements, relations and diagram objects a run puts on the view, with the predicted counts.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Layout graph" id="id-6ffffdc88fdc546e86841822e9756e0c">
          <documentation>The engine's input: nodes (occurrences), edges (routed relations), parent map, sizes, options (types/layout.d.ts).</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Layout result" id="id-1ca00ecc185653a68ba1f3890bdf3c21">
          <documentation>The engine's output: node positions and container sizes, edge bendpoints; leaf sizes as in the layout graph (no post-layout scaling).</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Write plan" id="id-1c9114597cf257d98bac60585be6f197">
          <documentation>What the writer does to the target view: nodes parents first, removals, connections, nestings, records. One shape for all four actions.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Dialog counts" id="id-10a49556c4da5f4a906339c6ead51c8a">
          <documentation>Per-condition counts, step additions, the predicted totals and the saved-preset compare the dialog shows.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
      </folder>
      <folder name="Archi model" id="id-cbcbc0d3f6b8518dbd8047d2412cfa2e">
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Model concepts" id="id-e1764578bf9d57ffba0c878cfb614ed1">
          <documentation>The elements and relations of the user's model; a run reads them and never modifies a relation (Scripts/View/AGENTS.md rule 6).</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="View" id="id-83ae21baa2aa5dbe8a4cf8e16fcdb782">
          <documentation>The target view: created or emptied by New view and One view each, changed by Expand view and Layout only; carries the view properties and the Managed occurrence records.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
      </folder>
      <folder name="Settings" id="id-8bf725509c4c50008721ba911eaa0db0">
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Preset" id="id-158c1a674cfc57a4ad855aa044f8fa59">
          <documentation>A named set of settings (selection, layout, appearance, view properties), validated against defs.js on load; folders allowed. Default = code defaults, all = base preset of the entry scripts. Tracked.</documentation>
          <property key="path" value="Scripts/View/presets/**/*.json"/>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Session" id="id-e84cfece74e2510c9a951e51c3a4a519">
          <documentation>The dialog's last settings plus UI state; the next algorithm start of the cycle script. Git-ignored, one per machine.</documentation>
          <property key="path" value="Scripts/View/presets/_session.json"/>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Palettes" id="id-25ff31a960b956f487b66d19231e48fe">
          <documentation>Named colours and colour ranges the presets pick from. Tracked.</documentation>
          <property key="path" value="Scripts/View/presets/_palettes.json"/>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Hidden properties" id="id-6b33bc8d494f5cfbafe264ce816f5434">
          <documentation>View property keys the Properties tab hides and generation leaves alone. Tracked.</documentation>
          <property key="path" value="Scripts/View/presets/_hidden_properties.json"/>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Program paths" id="id-f6b445a5f3c3578099fdbf23fb2a14b9">
          <documentation>Where node and dot are, per machine: config.default.js (tracked) and config.js (git-ignored).</documentation>
          <property key="path" value="Scripts/View/config.default.js, config.js"/>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
      </folder>
      <folder name="Test data" id="id-9f28bf81f19d541f801a778de44d4834">
        <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Test model" id="id-d89dae73aea5548ea4ceade0fb5d10c2">
          <documentation>The View test model, in the repo; rebuilt only with every expected file.</documentation>
          <property key="path" value="Scripts/View/test/model/view-test.archimate"/>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Test views" id="id-44c67892666c54f18cb4ee461b543dad">
          <documentation>Views/Test: 1 Nesting, 2 Edited, 3 Network, 4 Parts, 5 Large; a run must leave them as they are.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Baseline views" id="id-7846d5a2fd8f59e9a0c71e92a5866121">
          <documentation>Views/Baseline: the written result of the 12-run matrix (14 views); committed only for a meant change.</documentation>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="Test presets" id="id-68569cdedfd05e97a1bc0811605ddbe3">
          <documentation>baseline.json, AlgoTwopi.json and counters.json for the baseline and the Node checks; not edited without a new baseline. Other test presets in presets/Test.</documentation>
          <property key="path" value="Scripts/View/presets/Test/baseline/"/>
          <property key="view-architecture export date" value="2026-11-03T16:31:01.749Z"/>
