  <folder name="Views" id="id-bed413cc0f9b5269a4436b34af8aa508" type="diagrams"/>
  <purpose>The software architecture of the View subsystem (Scripts/View) and its wrappers: modules, their dependencies, the data they use, and the workflows to run, design, build, test, version and commit. Built by build_architecture_model.ajs from architecture_model.js.

Conventions: one application component per file; a dependency (A requires, loads or starts B) is a serving relation B → A; business processes for people and agents, application processes for scripts; business processes access business objects (documentation and instructions are business objects); application components and system software access data objects and serve the application processes that use the data; a data object realises the business object it holds; properties path, runtime, typechecked, version.</purpose>
</archimate:model>
